      "html": "<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.mandatory-note\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-top:56px\"><p class=\"note\" role=\"note\">No equipment, studio, event, platform, partner technology or instruction is operational. Media participation requires consent, and safeguarding requirements apply to participants under 18.</p></section>"
